# Build artefacts must never be tracked: a git worktree would check out a
# stale binary at the conventional path, and a lane that builds there can
# render against an engine that is not the one it thinks it is testing.
# Covers build/ (native) and the README's own cross-compile directory names
# (build-win32/, build-win64/, build-linux-x86/, build-linux-arm32/, ...).
build/
build-*/

# Consolidated device ROMs, named per emusc-render/emuscd's --rom-dir
# convention (README.md). Roland's own data, never tracked or published.
roms/
